  "criterion": "The complete authenticated Target119 AutofixPr UI unit is admitted only with its runtime wrapper call, result-state switch, compiler-cache topology, export adapter, module initializer, and command lazy-loader boundary. Exact canonical preservation through Targets120 and 121 authenticates the unit. The packaged source is the stale Target118 inline implementation and cannot be replayed as the extracted Target119 UI.",
